# The studio is committed; what it produces is not. Scenarios and the videos
# written from them live in videos/, renders land in out/.
#
# Ignore the files in videos/, not its folders. Tailwind reads this file as
# well, and it will not look inside an ignored folder even when studio.css
# names it as a source: a video's own classes would then produce no CSS.
videos/**
!videos/**/
!videos/.gitkeep
out/
